@startuml
autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
title UC-18 - User (Logged-in) Checkout

actor "User" as Actor
boundary "Checkout / Payment UI" as FE
control "PaymentController" as API
control "PaymentService" as Service
database "MongoDB: bills, shoesDetail, coupons" as DB

Actor -> FE: Start UC-18
FE -> API: POST /payments or POST /payments/stripe/create-intent
API -> Service: Execute User (Logged-in) Checkout
Service -> DB: Read/write bills, shoesDetail, coupons
DB --> Service: Domain data
Service --> API: Result
API --> FE: Response
FE --> Actor: Redirect đến thanh toán

alt Alternative / exception flow
  note over FE,Service: Chọn address mặc định -> tự động fill
end

note over Actor,DB
Pre: Đã đăng nhập, cart có items
Post: Redirect đến thanh toán
Main flow:
1. User vào checkout
2. System pre-fill thông tin từ profile (name, email, phone)
3. User chọn từ saved addresses hoặc nhập address mới
4. Các bước còn lại giống UC-09 Guest Checkout
end note
@enduml
